h a MDRO</h4>\n                    </div>\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"right-column\">\n            <div class=\"image-placeholder placeholder\">[Illustration: Healthcare worker attending to patient in bed, with purple germ icons highlighting arm and leg]</div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"main-footer\">\n        <div class=\"footer-left\">\n            <p>Protect residents and<br>stop the spread of germs.</p>\n            <div class=\"link-box\">bit.ly/PPE-LTCFs</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer-right\">\n            <div class=\"qr-section\">\n                <p>Scan to watch<br>an EBP video.</p>\n                <div class=\"qr-placeholder placeholder\">[QR Code]</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"logo-placeholder placeholder\">[Logos: HHS and CDC]</div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
